@Ecommerce_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109                                             
                                                                                               
### 1. Get All Jerseys (Check existing items)                                              
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                  
Accept: application/json                                                                   
                                                                                               
### 2. Create a Valid Jersey (Real Madrid Home Kit)                                        
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                 
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "Real Madrid 24/25 Home Kit",                                                    
    "club": "Real Madrid",                                                                   
    "description": "Authentic player edition jersey with gold details",                      
    "imageUrls": [                                                                           
    "https://example.com/realmadrid-front.jpg"                                             
    ],                                                                                       
    "price": 1500.00,                                                                        
    "stockQuantity": 25                                                                      
}                                                                                          
                                                                                               
### 3. Test FluentValidation: Create an INVALID Jersey (Negative price & empty name)       
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                 
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "",                                                                              
    "club": "Barcelona",                                                                     
    "description": "Test kit",                                                               
    "imageUrls": [],                                                                         
    "price": -500.00,                                                                        
    "stockQuantity": -5                                                                      
}           


### 4. Get Jersey By ID (Replace with an ID from Step 2)                                                      
@sampleJerseyId = 6cd934ab-5cce-4b49-a62c-bb4398939013
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                                
                                                          
### 5. Get Jersey By Non-Existent ID (Expect 404 NotFound)                                                  
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/b1f6d808-9c4a-4e31-baa1-672dceefb7cf                        
Accept: application/json     


### 6. Patch / Update Only the Price (e.g. 1850 BDT)  
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": 1850.00                                    
}                                                     
                                                          
### 7. Patch / Update Price AND Stock                 
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": 2100.00,                                   
    "stockQuantity": 50                                 
}                                                     
                                                          
### 8. Patch with Invalid Data (Expect 400 Validation Error)                                                  
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": -100.00                                    
}   

### 8. Delete a Jersey By ID (Returns 204 No Content!)                                     
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/6b3628b4-e76f-4fc7-9ed9-44492cfc6da9                   
                                                                                               
### 9. Delete with Fake ID (Tests 404 Not Found!)                                          
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000



### 1. Get Page 1 (Default: 10 items)                                                      
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                  
Accept: application/json                                                                   
                                                                                               
### 2. Get Page 1 with Custom Page Size of 2                                               
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?page=1&pageSize=2                                
Accept: application/json                                                                   
                                                                                               
### 3. Get Page 2 with Page Size of 2                                                      
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?page=1&pageSize=101                                
Accept: application/json    



                                           
                                                                                               
### 1. Create a Club: Real Madrid                                                          
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs                                                   
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "Real Madrid",                                                                   
    "country": "Spain",                                                                      
    "league": "La Liga",                                                                     
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/realmadrid-logo.png"                                     
}                                                                                          
                                                                                               
### 2. Get All Clubs (Grab the "id" of Real Madrid from the response!)                     
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs                                                    
Accept: application/json                                                                   
                                                                                               
### 3. Create a Jersey linked to Real Madrid!                                              
# (Replace PASTE-REAL-MADRID-CLUB-ID-HERE with the actual GUID from Step 2)                
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                 
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "Real Madrid 24/25 Home Kit",                                                    
    "description": "Authentic player edition jersey with gold details",                      
    "imageUrls": [                                                                           
    "https://example.com/realmadrid-front.jpg"                                             
    ],                                                                                       
    "price": 1500.00,                                                                        
    "stockQuantity": 25,                                                                     
    "clubId": "418f1068-b7c2-44e0-8806-c86a07e9547c"                                               
}                                                                                          
                                                                                               
### 4. Get All Jerseys (Notice how the Club is now nested inside the Jersey!)              
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                  
Accept: application/json   


### Test Global Exception Handler (Expects 500 Internal Server Error + RFC 9457 JSON)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/crash-test     



### 1. Register a New Customer                                     
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register                   
Content-Type: application/json                                     
                                                                       
{                                                                  
    "fullName": "Ikhtiar",                                           
    "email": "ikhtiar@example.com",                                  
    "password": "Password123!"                                       
}                                                                  
                                                                       
### 2. Test Duplicate Email Protection (Should return 400 Bad Request!)                                                            
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register                   
Content-Type: application/json                                     
                                                                       
{                                                                  
    "fullName": "Duplicate User",                                    
    "email": "ikhtiar@example.com",                                  
    "password": "Password123!"                                       
}  



### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
### 🔐 AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN TESTS                                                                                                                                                    
### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 1. Register a Normal Customer                                                                                                                                                      
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register                                                                                                                                       
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "fullName": "Sakib Al Hasan",                                                                                                                                                      
    "email": "sakib@customer.com",                                                                                                                                                     
    "password": "Password123!"                                                                                                                                                         
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 2. Login as Customer (Captures JWT Token in @customerToken)                                                                                                                        
# @name customerLogin                                                                                                                                                                  
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login                                                                                                                                          
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "email": "sakib@customer.com",                                                                                                                                                     
    "password": "Password123!"                                                                                                                                                         
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### Save the token from the login response above                                                                                                                                       
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 3. Test Invalid Password on Login (Expects 400 Bad Request)                                                                                                                        
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login                                                                                                                                          
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "email": "sakib@customer.com",                                                                                                                                                     
    "password": "WrongPassword!"                                                                                                                                                       
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
### 🛡️ AUTHORIZATION & POLICY TESTS (AdminOnly Policy)                                                                                                                                 
### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 4. Public Route: Anyone can view jerseys (No Token needed -> 200 OK)                                                                                                               
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                                                                                                              
Accept: application/json                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 5. Security Test: Create a Club WITHOUT a Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized!)                                                                                                        
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs                                                                                                                                               
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "name": "Arsenal",                                                                                                                                                                 
    "country": "England",                                                                                                                                                              
    "league": "Premier League",                                                                                                                                                        
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/arsenal.png"                                                                                                                                       
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 6. Security Test: Create a Club with CUSTOMER Token (Expects 403 Forbidden!)                                                                                                       
# The user is logged in, but their role is "Customer", NOT "Admin".                                                                                                                    
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs                                                                                                                                               
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}                                                                                                                                                
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "name": "Arsenal",                                                                                                                                                                 
    "country": "England",                                                                                                                                                              
    "league": "Premier League",                                                                                                                                                        
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/arsenal.png"                                                                                                                                       
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
### 👑 ADMIN TESTS (Creating Jersey & Club with Admin Token)                                                                                                                           
### ====================================================================                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                           
# NOTE: To test Admin access, change Sakib's "Role" in your Postgres database                                                                                                          
# from 1 (Customer) to 2 (Admin) using pgAdmin / DBeaver / terminal:                                                                                                                   
# UPDATE "Users" SET "Role" = 2 WHERE "Email" = 'sakib@customer.com';                                                                                                                  
# Then re-run request #2 (customerLogin) to get a fresh token containing the Admin claim!                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 7. Create a Club with ADMIN Token (Expects 201 Created!)                                                                                                                           
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs                                                                                                                                               
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}                                                                                                                                                
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "name": "Arsenal",                                                                                                                                                                 
    "country": "England",                                                                                                                                                              
    "league": "Premier League",                                                                                                                                                        
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/arsenal.png"                                                                                                                                       
}                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                           
### 8. Create a Jersey with ADMIN Token (Expects 201 Created!)                                                                                                                         
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                                                                                                             
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}                                                                                                                                                
Content-Type: application/json                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                           
{                                                                                                                                                                                      
    "name": "Arsenal 24/25 Home Kit",                                                                                                                                                  
    "description": "Authentic cannon crest home jersey",                                                                                                                               
    "imageUrls": [                                                                                                                                                                     
            "https://example.com/arsenal-home.jpg"                                                                                                                                         
    ],                                                                                                                                                                                 
    "price": 1400.00,                                                                                                                                                                  
    "stockQuantity": 30,                                                                                                                                                               
    "clubId": "PASTE_YOUR_CLUB_GUID_HERE"                                                                                                                                              
}                        

### 1. Login with Registered Account (Returns JWT Token!)                                  
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login                                              
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "email": "ikhtiar@example.com",                                                          
    "password": "Password123!"                                                               
}

### 2. Refresh Token (Rotates the refresh token & gives a new access token!)                 
# (Paste the refreshToken from Step 1 here)                                                  
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh                                              
Content-Type: application/json                                                               
                                                                                                 
{                                                                                            
    "refreshToken": "Gjlayw89oLh7GevIAv6jIYwYASorTywfz8I765bFm5ApFRdAr2RdSiygvbIWElJhefg8VU9tuQICQaOdNR9xfQ=="                                                 
}                                                                                            
               